Vendored Shizuku wireless-ADB source
=====================================

The Kotlin source files in this directory (AdbClient.kt, AdbException.kt,
AdbKey.kt, AdbMdns.kt, AdbMessage.kt, AdbPairingClient.kt, AdbPairingService.kt,
AdbProtocol.kt) are vendored from Shizuku (https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku)
by RikkaApps.

They are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license text is
included in the repository at third_party/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

The `moe.shizuku.manager.adb` package name is preserved intentionally. The bundled
prebuilt native library `libadb.so` has its JNI entry class hardcoded to
`moe/shizuku/manager/adb/PairingContext`, so the package path must not be renamed.

EmbeddedAdbInit.kt in this directory is NOT from Shizuku. It is PhysiBoard's own
glue code and is covered by the project's GPLv3 license.
